!
! This catalogue contains source positions and estimates of flux density from
! reanalysis of VLBI experiments under absolute astrometry and geodesy
! programs at the VLBA, LBA, EVN, CVN, and IVS in 1994-2018, as well as other
! VLBI experiments under geodesy and absolute astrometry since 1980.04.11
! through 2018.05.03, in total 6881 experiments.
! 15.1 million values of group delays were used in the solution.
!
!
! If you use positions from this catalogue in your work, for example, for
! scheduling phase referencing observations, you are encouraged to include
! in your paper references to original publications:
!
